    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθέω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.362
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολὺ προθέεσκε</span>
			<i>he was</i> far <i>ahead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				22.459
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.515
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολείπομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				412a
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>outrun,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				315b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλη π. τῆς ὄψεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>run forward</i> or <i>forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.8.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.10.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>outrun, outstrip,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>.</div>
